name: ps_dispute_line
dataset: settlement_dispute
measure: count
by[2]: dispute_key,item_key
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
severity: CRITICAL
stormCap: 500
description: "A dispute line: an amount_mismatch or fx_difference beyond the agreement tolerance. One Incident per line; the Case Rule ps_dispute_case groups the lines of one partner and cycle (dispute_key) into one dispute Case. Runbook: config/runbooks/partner-settlement-runbooks.md."
